Section: misc
Priority: optional
Depends: @SHLIBS@, curl, sudo
Recommends: waydroid
Suggests: rb-taskmanager
Description: HTTP server letting Waydroid control the RB-06 host
 Small HTTP server (systemd service, port 8180) that lets the Waydroid
 Android VM control the Linux host: graceful shutdown (stops the Waydroid
 session and RB-01 first) and reboot. Serves the touch button page from
 /opt/rb-taskmanager/www and forwards /api/mode/N to the in-session layout
 switcher (package rb-taskmanager).
